{"id":"claim:nominal/concept-form-affiliative-form--the-possessed-form-of-seta-dog-is-seta","revision":1,"topic":"topic:nominal/concept-form-affiliative-form","topics":["topic:nominal/concept-form-affiliative-form","topic:nominal/concept-form-affiliative-form--short-long"],"statement":{"en":"The possessed form of seta 'dog' is seta-ha, and the possessed form of maciri 'knife' is maciri-hi, which can mean 'someone's dog' and 'someone's knife' on their own.","ja":"seta「犬」の所属形は seta-ha、maciri「小刀」の所属形は maciri-hi であり、単独で「誰かの犬」「誰かの小刀」を意味することができる。"},"type":"paradigm-cell","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"example_only","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["seta","seta-ha","maciri","maciri-hi"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0297-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
